-- avrti-refine: krama-driven graph refinement.
-- walks the refine krama chain declared in om5 (yantra.om5).
-- phase 1: sequential idempotent steps (sandhi-kosha → rashi-anuvada)
-- phase 2: fixpoint loop over nodes marked (yukta fixpoint)
-- adding a new refine step = add an om5 node with (krama ...) and (kriya ...)
(tantra avrti-refine (g)
  (walk-refine-chain g))
